				(field
					(name "Description") "2x20 2.54 mm FEMALE SOCKET on the underside - THE SOCKET ONLY. The Raspberry Pi is not part of the assembly and JLCPCB does not supply it. Fits ANY 40-pin Pi, not just a Zero 2 W: the header sits in the same place relative to the two header-side mounting holes on every model, so H1/H2 land on a full-size Pi's own holes and this board sits inside its outline. P1-7/26/29/31 = DPI_D0..D3 for FPP DPIPixels")
			)
